# Automated Engineering SOPs

Whenever the user mentions a bug, feature, or architecture review, automatically execute the corresponding SOP from `docs/agents/engineering_sop.md`.

## Response Prefix
Always lead with the compact phase card:
```markdown
> 📌 **[SOP 名称]** `[■■□□□] 阶段 X/Y: 阶段名称` | **关联工单**: `#ID` (若有)
> **当前目标**: [一句话描述] | **下一步驱动**: [主动引导下一步动作]
```

## SOP Mapping & Mandatory Skill Auto-Loading (MUST read `SKILL.md` before coding)
- **SOP-1 (Bug Fix)**: Auto-load `diagnosing-bugs` + `tdd` + `ponytail`. Capture & Issue -> Feedback Loop -> Hypotheses -> TDD -> Deploy.
- **SOP-2 (Feature & Coding)**: Auto-load `grill-with-docs` (when underspecified) and **ALWAYS auto-load `codebase-design` + `tdd` + `ponytail` before coding**. Listen & Grill -> Domain/ADR -> Spec -> TDD Implement -> `code-review` & Deploy.
- **SOP-3 (Review & Refactor)**: Auto-load `codebase-design` + `ponytail-review` + `code-review`. Scope -> Audit bloat/depth -> Refactor Spec -> Dual-axis Review.
- **Lite Mode**: Trivial text/style fixes use 2-step fast track with `ponytail`.
